  "created": "2026-11-26T17:45:41.207Z",
  "description": "A high-performance, fully custom-drawn KumikoUI DataGrid control for the Uno Platform. Renders via SkiaSharp (SKXamlCanvas) on Windows (WinUI), desktop (Windows, macOS, Linux), WebAssembly, Android and iOS, reusing the same engine as KumikoUI.Maui.",
  "iconFile": "logo.png",
  "id": "KumikoUI.Uno",
  "isPrerelease": false,
